@verbatim
## {{ModuleName}} Module

The {{ModuleName}} module is a Noerd tenant app (Composer package `noerd/{{module-name}}`,
namespace `Noerd\{{ModuleName}}`). The framework rules (lists, details, pages, modals, themes,
tests, translations) come from the `noerd/noerd` guideline — this block only adds what is specific
to this module.

### Purpose
- Describe what the module manages here (main model: `{{Model}}`, table `{{table}}`).

### Structure
- Models: `src/Models/` (`{{Model}}`), `$guarded = []`, `BelongsToTenant`
- Livewire components (flat, in `resources/views/components/`): `{{models}}-list.blade.php`,
  `{{model}}-detail.blade.php` — Livewire namespace `{{module-name}}::`
- YAML: `app-configs/{{module-name}}/lists/{{models}}-list.yml`,
  `app-configs/{{module-name}}/details/{{model}}-detail.yml`, `app-configs/{{module-name}}/navigation.yml`
  — keep the module copy and the installed project copy (`app-configs/{{module-name}}/…`) in sync
- Routes: `routes/{{module-name}}-routes.php` — middleware `['noerd', 'app-access:{{module-name}}']`, names
  `{{module-name}}` (dashboard), `{{module-name}}.{{models}}` (list) and `{{module-name}}.{{model}}.detail` (record route used by
  route modals)
- Tenant app name is `{{MODULE_KEY}}` (uppercase) — gates and test traits compare exactly
- Translations: `resources/lang/de.json` (English keys)
- Migrations / factories / seeders / tests live inside the module

### Commands
- `php artisan noerd:install-{{module-name}}` — installs YAML configs, registers the tenant app, runs migrations
- `php artisan noerd:update-{{module-name}}` — idempotent update of the YAML configs (picked up by
  `noerd:update-all`)

### Tests
- Pest tests in `tests/`; run with `php artisan test --compact app-modules/{{module-name}}/tests`
- Prove mechanics, never the current YAML configuration (see the `noerd-testing` skill)
@endverbatim
